---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const rel = "https://github.com/Elchi-dev/conduit/releases/latest";
const items = [
  ["Windows", "Installer for Windows 10 and 11. Starts Conduit in the tray and keeps it updated.", "Conduit_x64-setup.exe"],
  ["macOS", "Apple silicon and Intel. Drag to Applications.", "Conduit_universal.dmg"],
  ["Linux", "AppImage, .deb and .rpm. The tray needs an app-indicator extension on GNOME.", "Conduit_amd64.AppImage"],
  ["Android", "Install the APK directly; it isn't in an app store. Pair it with your computer by scanning a code.", "conduit-android.apk"],
];
---
<Base page="download" title="Download">
  <div class="wrap dl">
    <h1>Download Conduit</h1>
    <p class="lede">The desktop app runs Conduit on your computer and keeps it up to date. Every update is signed; the app refuses anything else.</p>
    <div class="dl-list">
      {items.map(([os, text, file]) => (
        <div class="dl-row">
          <div><h2>{os}</h2><p class="muted">{text}</p></div>
          <a class="btn" href={rel}>{file}</a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="muted">What's new in each version is in the <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="sub">Servers and headless machines</h2>
    <p class="muted">The daemon alone, for a server, a NAS or a Raspberry Pi. One static binary for Linux, macOS and Windows on amd64 and arm64. It updates itself from signed releases and rolls back a version that won't start.</p>
    <pre><code>conduitd -listen 0.0.0.0:7600 -data /var/lib/conduit</code></pre>
    <p class="muted">Then open <span class="data">http://&lt;machine&gt;:7600</span> and create the owner account with the setup code from the log.</p>

    <h2 class="sub">Run a hub</h2>
    <p class="muted">A hub lets phones reach your computers from anywhere. Use the default hub, or run your own with Docker. <a href="/docs/self-hosting/">Self-hosting guide</a>.</p>
    <pre><code>docker compose -f deploy/hub/compose.yaml up -d</code></pre>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .dl {
    padding-top: 56px;
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 44px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 36em;
  }
  .dl-list {
    margin-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .dl-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .dl-row h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 21px;
  }
  .dl-row p {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .sub {
    margin: 56px 0 8px;
    font-size: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  pre {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .dl-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>
